# Task 146-005: Prompt God Template — buildTaskPrompt Single Entry

## Approach
1. Create `src/orchestra/prompt-god-template.ts` (~350 LoC)
   - PromptArtifact interface
   - SprintContext interface (minimal subset needed)
   - buildTaskPrompt(task, ctx) → PromptArtifact
   - Internal pipeline: classifyTaskType → selectAgent → selectSkills → selectRelevantAdrs(topN=3) → sanitizeScope → renderTemplate
   - Metadata: agent, skills, adrIds, scopeWarnings, charCount, estimatedTokens

2. Modify `src/orchestra/task-builder.ts`
   - Import buildTaskPrompt from prompt-god-template.ts
   - Refactor buildWorkerPrompt() to delegate to buildTaskPrompt() internally
   - Keep backward-compat signature (task, agentPrompt?, skillPrompts?)

3. Create `tests/orchestra/prompt-god-template.test.ts` (15 tests)
   - Tests 1-3: core-dev / docs / test tasks select correct agent + ADR
   - Test 4: charCount < 30000
   - Test 5: estimatedTokens < 25000
   - Test 6: adrMode summary when ADR > 3000 chars
   - Test 7: empty filler headers skipped
   - Test 8: agent prompt no truncation
   - Test 9: skill prompts injected in order
   - Test 10: scope warnings visible
   - Test 11: ADR topN=3
   - Test 12: dependencies info in prompt
   - Test 13: rubric spec NOT in prompt
   - Test 14: token usage spec present
   - Test 15: honest assessment block present

## Files Changed
- NEW: src/orchestra/prompt-god-template.ts
- MODIFIED: src/orchestra/task-builder.ts
- NEW: tests/orchestra/prompt-god-template.test.ts
